2 CONT *A1. Jiri z Podiebrad a Kunstatu, hejtman Boleslavského kraje 1440, Regent of Bohemia (1452-58), King of Bohemia (1458-71) elected 2.3.1458, *23.4.1420, +Prague 22.3.1471; 1m: 1441 Kunka "Kunigunde" ze Sternberka (*18.11.1422 +19.
2 CONC 11.1449); 2m: 1450 Johanna von Rosenthal (Johanka z Rozmitalu) (*1425, +Melnik 14.11.1475, bur there), dau.of Jan Lev z Rozmitalu by Eliska z Kravarz
