2 CONT >'''Predecessor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Franz-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg/3137536 Francis I] '''Successor:''' [http://www.geni.com/people/Franz-I-von-Sachsen-Lauenburg/3137536 Francis I]
