2 CONT No. He was born in this place which used to be "Holy Roman Empire". Which was not Holy, not Roman, perhaps i was an empire.  
2 CONT
2 CONT But today the birth place is in Czechia so the birth place must be named according to that. If not, then Geni will not be able to parse the locations on the map correctly. There is plenty of room to address the issue of Kingdom of
2 CONC  Bohemia in this field, right here if one so wishes to do. .  
