1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Der WinterKönig==
2 CONT
2 CONT ==The Winter King==
2 CONT
2 CONT Friedrich V von der Pfalz, King of Bohemia was born on 26 August 1596 at Amberg, Germany. He was the son of Friedrich IV Kurfürst von der Pfalz and Louise Juliana van Oranje-Nassau. He married Elizabeth Stuart, Princess of England
2 CONC , daughter of James I Charles Stuart, King of Great Britain and Anne Oldenburg, Princess of Denmark, on 14 February 1613. He died on 29 November 1632 at age 36 at Mainz, Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT *Member of the House of Wittelsbach.
2 CONT *Elector(Kurfürst) von der Pfalz in 1610.
2 CONT *King of Bohemia in 1619.
2 CONT *Deposed as King of Bohemia in 1620. 
2 CONT *Deposed as (Elector)Kurfürst von der Pfalz in 1623.
2 CONT
