2 CONT ----
2 CONT ==Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_II,_Landgrave_of_Hesse-Darmstadt
2 CONT
2 CONT George II of Hesse-Darmstadt, German: Georg II von Hessen-Darmstadt (17 March 1605, in Darmstadt – 11 June 1661) was the Landgrave of Hesse-Darmstadt from 1626 to 1661.
2 CONT
2 CONT Early life and ancestry
2 CONT Born into the House of Hesse, George was the eldest son of Ludwig V and his wife, Magdalene of Brandenburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 
2 CONT On 1 April 1627 in Torgau, he married Sophia Eleonore of Saxony. Together, they had 15 children, three sons and twelve daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT From 1645 to 1648 he led the so-called Hessenkrieg against the Landgravine Amalie Elizabeth of Hesse-Kassel over the inheritance of the extinct line of Hesse-Marburg. This conflict resulted in the loss of Hesse-Marburg to Hesse-Ka
2 CONC ssel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # Louis VI (1630–1678), married Maria Elisabeth of Holstein-Gottorp
2 CONT # Magdalena Sybilla (3 September 1631 – 5 August 1651), never married
2 CONT # George (1632–1676), married Duchess Dorothea Augusta of Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg
2 CONT # Sophia Eleonore (1634–1663), married Landgrave William Christoph of Hesse-Homburg
2 CONT # Elisabeth Amalie (1635–1709), married Philip William, Elector Palatine
2 CONT # Louise Christine (15 January 1636 – 11 November 1697), married Christoph Ludwig I, Count of Stolberg-Stolberg and had issue.
2 CONT # Anna Maria (9 February 1637 – 21 April 1637), died young
2 CONT # Anna Sophia II, Princess-Abbess of Quedlinburg (1638–1683)
2 CONT # Amalia Juliana (28 November 1639– 20 December 1639), died young
2 CONT # Stillborn daughter (1640)
2 CONT # Henrica Dorothea (14 October 1641 – 22 December 1672), married Count John II of Waldeck-Landau
2 CONT # John (24 November 1642 – 22 February 1643), died young
2 CONT # Augusta Philippina (29 December 1643 – 4 February 1672), never married.
2 CONT # Agnes (11 November 1645 – 12 November 1645), died young
2 CONT # Marie Hedwig (1647–1680), married Duke Bernhard I of Saxe-Meiningen
2 CONT
2 CONT
