1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00016086&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Born in Heidelberg on 27 October 1619, in 1645 he both married his cousin Juliana Magdalena of Zweibrücken and succeeded his father as Count Palatine in Landsberg. In 1661 he also succeeded as Duke of Zweibrücken. By his
2 CONC  wife, who died in March 1672, he was the father of thirteen children. Five months after her death he was married morganatically to Maria Elisabeth Hepp and fathered another five children who received the surname of von Fürstenwär
2 CONC ther. He died in Landsberg in 1681.
