2 TITL Ernest Augustus, Duke of Brunswick
2 NOTE Ernest Augustus, Elector of Hanover
3 CONT
3 CONT 20 November 1629 – 23 January 1698) was duke of Brunswick-Lüneburg and ruled over the Calenberg (or Hanover) subdivision of the duchy. He was appointed prince-elector, but died before the appointment became effective. He was also 
3 CONC Prince-Bishop of Osnabrück.
3 CONT
3 CONT Read more about Ernest in his profile.
