2 CONT Dorothea Sophie Pfalzgräfin von Neuburg was born on 5 July 1670. (1) She was the daughter of Philip Wilhelm Kurfürst von der Pfalz and Elisabeth Amalie Prinzessin von Hessen-Darmstadt.1 She married Odoardo II Farnese, Duca di Parm
2 CONC a, son of Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma and Isabella d'Este, Principessa di Modena, on 17 September 1690. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 15 September 1748 at age 78. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorothea Sophie Pfalzgräfin von Neuburg was a member of the House of Pfalz-Neuburg. She gained the title of Pfalzgräfin von Neuburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Dorothea Sophie Pfalzgräfin von Neuburg and Odoardo II Farnese, Duca di Parma
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Isabella Elizabeth Farnese+ b. 25 Oct 1692, d. 11 Jul 1766
2 CONT
