2 CONT
2 CONT      Anna Katharina Gräfin von Nassau-Ottweiler was born on 21 January 1653 at Ottweiler, Germany. (1) She was the daughter of Johann Ludwig Graf von Nassau-Ottweiler and Dorothea Katharina Pfalzgräfin von Birkenfeld. (1) She marr
2 CONC ied Johann Philipp Graf zu Salm-Dhaun, son of Johann Ludwig zu Salm-Dhaun and Elisabeth zu Salm-Neuviller, on 11 November 1671. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 15 February 1731 at age 78 at Ottweiler, Germany. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      From 11 November 1671, her married name became zu Salm-Dhaun. (1)
