2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/D/per_page.php?id=121859 Geneall] Ruperta Hughes was born illegitimately in 1671.1 She was the daughter of Rupert von der Pfalz, Duke of Cumberland and Mrs. Margaret Hughes.1 She married Lt.-Gen. Emanuel S
2 CONC crope Howe, son of John Grubham Howe and Lady Annabella Scrope. She died circa 24 July 1741.2 She was buried on 27 July 1741 at Binstead, Hampshire, England.2
2 CONT      Her married name became Howe. Children of Ruperta Hughes and Lt.-Gen. Emanuel Scrope Howe Rachel Howe2 d. c 14 Apr 1701 Sophia Arabella Howe3 b. bt 28 Dec 1698 - 28 Dec 1699, d. 4 Apr 1726 Major William Howe+1 b. 24 Mar 1699/
