1 OCCU von 1682 bis 1698 der vorletzte regierende Herzog von Kurland und Semgallen aus der Dynastie Kettler.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederick_Casimir_Kettler
2 CONT
2 CONT Frederick Casimir Kettler (German: Friedrich Casimir Kettler; 6 July 1650 – 22 January 1698) was Duke of Courland and Semigallia from 1682 to 1698. Frederick Casimir was the son of Jacob Kettler and Louise Charlotte of Brandenburg
2 CONC . In his reign the Duchy lost its geopolitical position and became Sweden, Prussia and Russia's territorial subject of interests.
2 CONT
