1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''William Remy, Sr.'''. was born 1672 in Westmoreland Co., Virginia, and died 1738. He married Catherine Asbury  1693 in Westmoreland Co., Virginia,  daughter of Henry Asbury and Mary Durrant . She was born 1672 i
2 CONC n Westmoreland Co., Virginia, and died 1738 in Westmoreland Co., Virginia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William Remy, Sr. and Catherine Asbury are:
2 CONT * WILLIAM7 REMY, JR., b. Abt. 1696, Westmoreland Co., Virginia, USA; d. 1758, Frederick (now Warren) Co., Va., USA.
2 CONT *JACOB REMY, b. Abt. 1698, Westmoreland Co., Virginia, USA; d. 1735, Westmoreland Co., Virginia, USA; m. ANN CARR, Abt. 1718; b. Abt. 1698.
2 CONT *ASBURY REMY, b. Abt. 1700; d. Aft. 1759; m. ELIZABETH HANNAH NEAL; b. Abt. 1700.
2 CONT *MARY REMY, b. June 19, 1709; m. WILLIAM SAUNDERS; b. Abt. 1709.
2 CONT *CATHERINE REMY, b. Abt. 1710; m. UNKNOWN WORMUTH, Abt. 1728; b. Abt. 1710.
2 CONT *JOHN REMY, b. Abt. 1712, Virginia, USA; d. 1791, Henry Co., Va., USA; m. MARY LINTON, April 06, 1740; b. Abt. 1712.
2 CONT *JAMES REMY, b. Abt. 1715; d. 1757, Frederick (now Warren) Co., Va., USA; m. ELIZABETH UNKNOWN, Abt. 1735; b. Abt. 1715.
2 CONT *DANIEL REMY, b. Abt. 1720, Fredericksburg, Virginia, USA; d. Bef. 1763.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lineage - William Remy, Sr.;JACQUES (JACOB; PIERRE; JACQUES; GEORGE; DIDIER.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sometimes William Remy is described as "William Byron Remy" in family trees. A source is needed for this middle name.  Given the various Westmoreland County, Virginia deed, Court Records and 2 will books that I (Brian Ramey, per r
2 CONC esearch by Dr. Roy Richard Ramey) could add under sources, not once was a middle name entered into record.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *William Ramey (1672-1737) and Catherine (Asbury)  Ramey (1672-1738) ) Catherine (Asbury)  Ramey was the daughter of:
2 CONT *Henry Asbury (1650-1706) and Mary (Durrant) Asbury (1650-1709) from Westmoreland, Virginia.  Henry and Mary were married in 1671 and traveled from Maryland to Virginia.  Catherine Ramey was the granddaughter of:   
2 CONT *  Francis & Mary (Powell)  Asbury  Francis Asbury (1630 – 1682)  was an immigrant from England,    who drowned in Maryland.  Francis Asbury was married to  Mary Powell who was born in 1632 in England.    They had a son named Henr
2 CONC y Asbury Born 1650.
2 CONT *    Henry & Mary (??) Durrant, Henry Durant was born 1638 in Virginia.  They had a daughter Mary (Durrant) Asbury Born 1650
2 CONT
