2 CONT
2 CONT M, #97910, b. 14 February 1708, d. 2 November 1772
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 Nov 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Johann Wilhelm Graf von Manderscheid-Blankenheim was born on 14 February 1708.2 He married, firstly, Luise Franziska Wilhelmine Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm, daughter of Nikolaus Leopold Prinz zu Salm-Salm and Dorothea Franziska A
2 CONC gnes Prinzessin zu Salm, on 19 March 1743. He married, secondly, Johanna Maximiliane Limburg-Styrum on 24 May 1766.2 He died on 2 November 1772 at age 64.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Johann Wilhelm Graf von Manderscheid-Blankenheim gained the title of Graf von Manderscheid-Blankenheim.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Johann Wilhelm Graf von Manderscheid-Blankenheim and Luise Franziska Wilhelmine Prinzessin zu Salm-Salm
