1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anna Karolina likely had residence at [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gl%C3%BCcksburg_Castle Glücksburg Castle] during most of her life, from her first marriage in 1769 until she passed away. Glücksburg Castle was t
2 CONC he residence of her first husband Frederick Henry William, the last duke of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Gl%C3%BCcksburg_%28elder_line%29 Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Glücksburg line], and also
2 CONC  her second husband [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frederick_Charles_Ferdinand,_Duke_of_Brunswick-L%C3%BCneburg Frederick Charles Ferdinand] took up residence here after his appointment to Field Marshal of Denmark and his marriage
2 CONC  to Anna Karolina.
