2 CONT
2 CONT Elisabeth Farnese (Italian: Elisabetta Farnese, Spanish: Isabel de Farnesio; 22 October 1692 – 11 July 1766), the daughter of Odoardo II Farnese and Dorothea Sophie of the Palatinate-Neuburg, was Queen consort of Spain who exerted
2 CONC  great influence over Spain's foreign policy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
2 CONT [show]
2 CONT
