2 CONT Her Parentage is uncertain:
2 CONT
2 CONT *1) Sarolta II. Ferenc mostohalánya volt, Sarolta Amália és egy ismeretlen férfi kapcsolatából.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the '''stepdaughter''' of Ferenc II. by his wife Charlotte Amalie and an unknown man. Source: Temesvári Jenő (Nagykanizsa)
