2 CONT "He was the son of Lt.-Gen. Emanuel Scrope Howe and Ruperta Hughes. He was baptized on 14 August 1704 at St. Martin-in-the-Fields Church, Covent Garden, London, England. He died circa 3 April 1728. He was buried on 6 April 1728 at
