1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George Augustus Hanover, 
2 CONT
2 CONT *Naturalized as a British subject in 1705.
2 CONT *Knight, Order of the Garter (K.G.) on 4 April 1706.
2 CONT *1st Viscount Northallerton, co. York [Great Britain] on 9 November 1706.
2 CONT *1st Baron of Tewkesbury, co. Gloucester [Great Britain] on 9 November 1706.
2 CONT *1st Duke of Cambridge [Great Britain] on 9 November 1706.
2 CONT *1st Marquess of Cambridge [Great Britain] on 9 November 1706.
2 CONT *1st Earl of Milford Haven [Great Britain] on 9 November 1706.
2 CONT *1st Duke of Rothesay [Great Britain] on 1 August 1714.
2 CONT *1st Duke of Cornwall [Great Britain] on 1 August 1714.
2 CONT *1st Earl of Chester [Great Britain] on 27 September 171.
2 CONT *HRH Prince of Wales [England] on 27 September 1714.
2 CONT *King of Great Britain on 28 May 1727.
2 CONT
2 CONT *Crowned King of Great Britain on 11 October 1727 at Westminster Abbey, Westminster, London, England, and styled 'King of Great Britain, France and Ireland, Duke of Brunswick-Luneburg, Elector of Hanover, Defender of the Faith.
