2 CONT Louis III de Bourbon, Prince de Condé (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #113771, b. 11 October 1668, d. 4 March 1710
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=3 Oct 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis III de Bourbon, Prince de Condé was born on 11 October 1668 at Paris, France. (1) He was the son of Henri Jules de Bourbon, Prince de Condé and Anne Henriette Julie Pfalzgräfin von Simmern. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Louise Françoise de Bourbon, daughter of Louis XIV, Roi de France and Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart, on 24 June 1685 at Versailles, Île-de-France, France. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 4 March 1710 at age 41 at Paris, France. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Louis III de Bourbon, Prince de Condé gained the title of Duc de Bourbon. (3) He gained the title of Prince de Condé. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Louis III de Bourbon, Prince de Condé and Louise Françoise de Bourbon
