2 CONT Of Holstein.  Elected King of Sweden by the Council of Sweden in an effort to strengthen foreign relations, upon the death of the King in 1751, leaving no heirs to succeed him.His wife was a sister to Frederick the Great (Frederic
2 CONC k II).  Ruled from 1751 - 1771.
