2 CONT >10.     [https://www.geni.com/people/Christian-Gyldenl%C3%B8ve-Sams%C3%B8/6000000006103074116?through=4517883609800058117  CHRISTIAN Gyldenløve Greve til Samsøe] (Copenhagen 28 Feb 1674-Odense 16 Jul 1703).  m firstly (Copenhagen
2 CONC  27 Nov 1696) CHARLOTTE AMALIE Grevinde Danneskiold-Laurvig, daughter of ULRIK FREDERIK Gyldenløve Greve af Laurvig & his third wife Antoinette Augusta Gräfin von Aldenburg (15 Nov 1682-Copenhagen 7 Dec 1699).  m secondly (Copenha
2 CONC gen 25 May 1701) as her second husband, DORTE Krag til Juellund, widow of JENS baron Juel, daughter of MOGENS Nielsen Krag til Kaas & his wife Helvig von der Kuhla (27 Sep 1675-Gisselfeld 10 Oct 1754, bur Eckernförde).  >Christian
2 CONC  & his first wife had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT >>a)         CHRISTIANE CHARLOTTE Grevinde af Danneskiold-Samsøe (Copenhagen 7 Jul 1698-5 Oct 1699). 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>b)         FREDERIKKE LOUISE Grevinde af Danneskiold-Samsøe (Akershus 2 Oct 1699-Sonderborg 2 Dec 1744).  m (Kalundborg/Copenhagen 21 Jul 1720) CHRISTIAN AUGUST Herzog von Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Augustenburg, son of FRIED
2 CONC RICH WILHELM Prinz von Schleswig-Holstein-Sonderburg-Augustenburg & his wife Sophie Amalie Gräfin von Ahlefeld (Augustenburg 4 Aug 1696-Augustenburg 20 Jan 1754, bur Sonderburg Schloßkapelle). 
2 CONT
