2 CONC & his wife Christiane Sophie Gräfin Reventlow (Copenhagen 3 or 31 Mar 1699-Copenhagen 23 Jun 1723).  m secondly (Copenhagen 4 Oct 1724) CHRISTINE CATHARINE von Holstein, daughter of CHRISTIAN FRIEDRICH von Holstein & his wife Bert
2 CONC e Scheel von Schack (Copenhagen 1709-Copenhagen 1 Feb 1795). -        LENSGREVE af DANNESKIOLD-SAMSØE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>d)         FREDERIK Greve af Danneskiold-Samsøe (Assendrup 1 Nov 1703-Arhus 18 Jul 1770).  m (Wedellsborg 31 Jul 1724) DORTE Grevinde Wedell-Wedellsborg, daughter of HANNIBAL Lensgreve Wedell-Wedellsborg & his wife Anna Catharin
2 CONC e Banner von Rugaard (1706-Soro 20 Jan 1763). -       LENSGREVE af DANNESKIOLD-SAMSØE. 
