1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Jacob Remy''' was born in 1684 in Westmoreland, Virginia, United States. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-90473806 William Remy, Sr.] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-113066915 Catherine Remy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacob married [https://www.geni.com/profile-71416655 Ann Remy] circa 1718. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34632059453 Frances Thomas];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-34692554382 Joseph Remy]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in June 1735 in Westmoreland County, Virginia, English Colony. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References'''
2 CONT
