2 CONT DANIEL7 REMY (WILLIAM6, JACQUES (JACOB)5, PIERRE4, JACQUES3, GEORGE2, DIDIER1) was born Abt. 1720 in Fredericksburg, Virginia, USA, and died Bef. 1763. He married DORCUS BRICKEY 1744 in Westmoreland Co., Virginia, USA, daughter of
