2 CONC 00000003219749417 Elizabeth]
2 CONT *[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_VI Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ivan VI 23 August [O.S. 12 August] 1740 – 16 July [O.S. 5 July] 1764), was proclaimed Emperor of Russia in 1740, as an infant, although he never actually reigned. Within less than a year, he was overthrown by the Empress Elizabeth
2 CONC  of Russia, Peter the Great's daughter. Ivan spent the rest of his life as a prisoner and was killed by his guards during an attempt made to free him in 1764..
