1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Frederick William II of Prussia 
2 CONT *Frederick William II (German: Friedrich Wilhelm II; 25 September 1744 in Berlin –16 November 1797 in Potsdam) was the fourth King of Prussia, reigning from 1786 until his death. 
2 CONT *He was in personal union the Prince-Elector of Brandenburg and the sovereign prince of the Principality of Neuchâtel.
