0 @N6000000002322305740@ NOTE He husband, Matthias, possessed high personal qualities, as reported by
1 CONT friends and foe alike. He tried to strengthen his state, not without success.
1 CONT His name became a symbol of strength and independence. His memory was
1 CONT glorified by statesmen and military leaders as well as by students of cultural
1 CONT progress. And, despite heavy taxes, it was only glorified by the people, who
1 CONT were reported , a few years after his death, as being willing to pay still
1 CONT more, "if only he could rise again. Matthias is dead --- justice is lost."
