1 CONT Britain, a fact that contributed to Jacobite plots to replace him with James
1 CONT II's son, James Edward Stuart, known as the Old Pretender.
0 @N6000000002322332540@ NOTE George never learned English and spent much of his life away from Great
1 CONT Britain, to the outrage of his British subjects. Hannover is now lower
1 CONT Saxony, Germany.  He was also Elector of Hannover, 1698-1727, as well as King
1 CONT of Great Britain from 1714-1727. Historical facts of the time: In 1718,
1 CONT Blackbeard the pirate was killed by militia. In 1719, James Figg became the
1 CONT first boxing champion in England, and one of the first Cricket matches was
1 CONT played when London met Kent.
