0 @N6000000002322332655@ NOTE Sophia, a cousin to her husband George I, was accused of adultery by George,
1 CONT then divorced and incarcerated from 1694 'til she died in 1726 - 32 years!
1 CONT Her marriage was an unhappy one. Her mother-in-law hated her, and this
1 CONT feeling was soon shared by her husband. Under these circumstances she made
1 CONT the acquaintance of Count Philipp Christoph von Konigsmark, who assisted her
1 CONT in one or two attempts to escape from Hanover and who was regarded as her
1 CONT lover. The Count assassinated,1694; Sophia imprisoned in the castle of Ahlden.
