0 @N6000000002322332713@ NOTE Original name: Sophie Fredericke Auguste von Anhalt-Zerbst, the daughter of a
1 CONT minor German Prince. She continued the process of Westernization begun by
1 CONT Peter I. Her marriage was unhappy, but she built up a circle of supporters. 10
1 CONT men occupied roles of lovers and favorites during her reign. Two were Grigory
1 CONT Orlov and Grigory Potenkin. Though German, she completely identified herself
1 CONT with Russian People. She greatly expanded the empire with 2 wars against the
1 CONT Ottoman empire, and the annexation of the Crimea in 1783.
