0 @N6000000002322332766@ NOTE George II was raised as a German prince. Like his father, George I, he was
1 CONT more interested in the affairs of Hannover than of Great Brtiain. His wife,
1 CONT Caroline, frequently acted as regent in London. When he died in 1760, he was
1 CONT succeeded by his grandson, George III. He ruled on the British throne from
1 CONT 1727-1760, and was Elector of Hannover from 1727-1760.
