0 @N6000000005598973464@ NOTE he was also Duke of Brunswick-Luneburg, Duke of Gloucester, Duke of Edinburgh, Marquess of Ely, Earl of Eltham, Viscount Launceston, Baron Snowdon, Duke of Cornwall, Kurprinz of Hanover, and earl of Chester
